WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.880
Since you started many years ago, there have been a lot of rule changes and . . . especially in football.

2
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.580
How do you feel that that’s affected the game?

3
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:18.460
Or as you see it, maybe as a trainer, do you feel like it’s caused a decrease in some of the . . .

4
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:18.700
Some of the injuries?

5
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.560
Some of the dangers?

6
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.000
Yeah.

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.780
Well, you know, I wanted to believe that the rule changes have always been for the better.

8
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:36.660
For instance now, Scott, the . . . you can’t block below the knee, you know.

9
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:40.300
Of course we still have knee injuries.

10
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:46.880
Of course we have knee injuries now, as you know, when there’s no contact made.

11
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.920
Some say that the artificial turf has contributed to that.

12
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.420
I don’t know whether it has or not.

13
00:00:53.420 --> 00:01:00.160
But, you know, you do have injuries, knee injuries now, when nobody receives a lick.

14
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:10.040
But usually the rule changes that have been made to protect the athlete and to speed up the game and make the game more interesting.

15
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.900
That, to me, has always been beneficial.
